---
name: snapshot-architecture
description: PropIQ snapshot persistence architecture.
---

# Authority

DATABASE_SCHEMA_DESIGN.md

ENGINE_CONTRACTS.md

# Core Principle

Snapshots are immutable.

Never update a snapshot.

Never recalculate a stored snapshot.

# Snapshot Stores

snapshot_inputs

snapshot_outputs

snapshot_intermediates

snapshot_risk_flags

snapshot_validation_warnings

# Requirements

Store:

- input values
- output values
- intermediates
- flags
- warnings
- assumption versions

# Historical Reproducibility

A snapshot must always reproduce the exact result originally generated.

# Forbidden

No edits.

No overwrite operations.

No recalculation during reads.